  (text_box "- The 12 array LEDs carry the silk names RJ7-RJ18, one pair of names per position.\n  Which name of a pair is the FX LED and which the POW LED is assumed; the pair\n  at P5 is printed in the order RJ10, RJ9.\n- The silk labels the positions P1 to P5; what drives the unlabelled position\n  (RJ7, RJ8) is unknown: no trace leaves U4 pin 67 (P9LED0) on the top layer.\n- No resistors sit inside the array. R2-R5, R103 and R110-R114 beside it may be\n  the LED resistors (not traced); the anode supply and the active-low drive from\n  U4 are inferred.\n- The POW LEDs are probably driven by the PoE module (not traced)." (at 27.94 149.86 0) (size 124.46 19.05) (stroke (width 0.1524) (type solid) (color 120 120 120 1)) (fill (type color) (color 255 255 225 1)) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4c6fdb5e-299d-54ff-b33f-6bfc124dace5))
